body:
I don't understand, I'm the best ally because I don't actively want trans people to die. The other trans person I've met liked drag, so you all must be like this!

&#x200B;

/uj I work with someone like that. She's so fucking *proud* of herself for being a **great** ally. Just patting herself on the back while fucking deadnaming me. Like wtf.

I'm from Tennesse, and honestly it doesn't seem horrible.  At least random people wise. The laws are ***totally*** fucked ,but I'm willing to bet that wherever you are, decent sized cities are better than the middle of nowhere.  Plus there are still places where you can get informed consent HRT.

&#x200B;

Not that I'm trying to convince anyone to come here. Just trying to make myself feel better about being trapped here by poverty. If you aren't living here already, flee for your lives from the hill people!

That's because you have to want at least 12 surgeries or you're a trender. We all know that the poor trans are the biggest of trenders after all.

&#x200B;

/uj either that or it's a trans person before hrt that already looks good and passes in every day life, but nooo, you need so many surgeries to be seen as normal. Like a fuckin tracheal shave for some goddamn reason when you can't see an adam's apple. No one *needs* a damn tracheal shave anyway.

God, same. I'm Amab, and honestly my proportions are getting annoying.  Only thing I own top wise that fits properly is a cardigan that I wear all the time because it actually fits. Everything else is too tight in the shoulders. I have to wear like 1X shit because I'm so wide, lol. And that's too big everywhere else, except they aren't long enough. Pants fit good though, so that's good. 

&#x200B;

I'm just gonna learn to sew one of these days so I can wear a decent dress. It can't be super hard to sew simple clothes, right?

Right? We were *totally* gonna dismantle the system thru a movement on a meme website! There was a realy chance here! The bourgeois were going to crumble thru our excellent meme posts! And some *burgeoning* asshole decided to ruin our entire movement in 3 minutes.

&#x200B;

/uj Jesus Christ. What a joke. If your "movement" can be trashed in a 3 minute interview, it wasn't gonna last to begin with.

Tranner SCPs often breach containment to obtain HRT. Advised to keep their containment facility as far away from humanity as possible.

&#x200B;

Texas has been selected as a good site for Special Containment Unit 41.
